{"4954710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Capsule Carnage: Don't Press That", "steam_appid": 4954710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capsule Carnage: Don't Press That Button is a fast-paced online party shooter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six-minute rounds. One island. A bunch of capsule dudes. And a mysterious button that keeps dropping from the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔴 That Button</strong> Press it for a 666-point jackpot with a free dual-wield… or an airstrike. Or a nuke that flattens the whole map. After the blast, all loot re-rolls to a single rarity color and everyone restarts with the same fallback weapon. Fresh start, old grudges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔫 Weapons &amp; Affixes</strong> Pistols, miniguns, snipers, katanas, grenade launchers, satellite lasers… Loot drops in White/Blue/Purple/Gold rarities. Stack affixes: damage, fire rate, range, dual-wield — twin blades, twin guns, twin lasers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚔️ Modes</strong> Free-for-all / 2v2v2 / 3v3 with a 10-second team-select before each round. Playing solo? Bots fill the room — they strafe, sneak, and fight for the button just like you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮 Play Your Way</strong> Full keyboard/mouse and controller support. One-click friend invites.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capsule Carnage: Don't Press That Button is a fast-paced online party shooter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six-minute rounds. One island. A bunch of capsule dudes. And a mysterious button that keeps dropping from the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔴 That Button</strong> Press it for a 666-point jackpot with a free dual-wield… or an airstrike. Or a nuke that flattens the whole map. After the blast, all loot re-rolls to a single rarity color and everyone restarts with the same fallback weapon. Fresh start, old grudges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔫 Weapons &amp; Affixes</strong> Pistols, miniguns, snipers, katanas, grenade launchers, satellite lasers… Loot drops in White/Blue/Purple/Gold rarities. Stack affixes: damage, fire rate, range, dual-wield — twin blades, twin guns, twin lasers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚔️ Modes</strong> Free-for-all / 2v2v2 / 3v3 with a 10-second team-select before each round. Playing solo? Bots fill the room — they strafe, sneak, and fight for the button just like you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎮 Play Your Way</strong> Full keyboard/mouse and controller support. One-click friend invites.</p>", "short_description": "A 2-6 player online party shooter! Capsule dudes, rarity-tiered weapons, dual-wield affixes — and a big red button that drops from the sky. Press it for a 666-point jackpot… or a nuke. Don't press that button. (You will.)", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954710/8ede11793ffaa3b1a4d42151402c94e4f02683e7/header.jpg?t=1786248292", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954710/8c5bff9958066ae73e9c21bdc8e770bce6b85f4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786248292", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4954710/8c5bff9958066ae73e9c21bdc8e770bce6b85f4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786248292", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible (integrated graphics OK)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><stron